# HG changeset patch
# User Betterbird <betterbird@betterbird.eu> and DeepSeek
# Date 1787905678 -7200
# Parent  0dbba9218f04c656a0a756ce7bffd5ecd6b1382a
Bug 2066371 - Fix template/archives location for IMAP servers which store folders in the INBOX. Fixes location pref value/picker mode.

Based on https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321858.
Ported to ESR 153 by Betterbird.
The following enhancements are by Betterbird:
- Switch picker to "Other" when the pref is fixed.
- Also fix the pref when saving the template (nsMsgCopy.cpp).
- When the archive location pref points to a non-existent folder, create that folder.
  Not optimal, but consitent with Drafts, Templates and Sent which all create a new folder.

